### Try the API from VS Code with the REST Client extension.
### Start the server first: npm run dev

@base = http://localhost:3000
@admin = change-this-password

### Shop settings
GET {{base}}/api/settings

### All products
GET {{base}}/api/products

### Beanies only
GET {{base}}/api/products?category=Beanies

### Create an order
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": { "name": "Jane Wanjiku", "phone": "0712345678", "email": "" },
  "items": [{ "productId": "p001", "colour": "Olive", "quantity": 2 }],
  "fulfilment": { "method": "pickup", "pickupPointId": "cbd-moi-avenue" }
}

### Check an order (paste the order number)
GET {{base}}/api/orders/OC-20261104-1234

### Start M-Pesa payment
POST {{base}}/api/mpesa/stkpush
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderNumber": "OC-20261104-1234" }

### Admin: all orders
GET {{base}}/api/admin/orders
x-admin-password: {{admin}}

### Admin: update stock
PATCH {{base}}/api/admin/products/p001/stock
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-password: {{admin}}

{ "stock": 30 }
